    "A CLUB FOR EVERY BODY" : {},
    "Apple 健康" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Health"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple 将提供你选择分享的账号信息，用于创建或恢复俱乐部身份。已有邮箱账号不会自动合并。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple shares the account details you choose, to create or restore your club identity. An existing email account isn’t merged automatically."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple 登录凭据不完整，请重试。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Sign in with Apple credential is incomplete. Try again."
