    "boji" : {},
    "一张属于你的身份卡，记录一起开始的这一天。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A card of your own, marking the day you started with us."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "三条共识，\n一起开始。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Three pledges.\nWe start together."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上一步" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Back"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上次同步 %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Last synced %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上次查询" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Last Checked"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不以身材、体重或体脂决定是否可以加入。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Body shape, weight or body fat never decides who can join."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不冒用他人身份，不在昵称中包含他人隐私。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Don’t pretend to be someone else, and don’t put other people’s private information in your nickname."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不影响手动记录，也不修改健康 App 中的原始数据。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This doesn’t affect manual logs or change the original data in the Health app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不必完美，也能开始。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No need to be perfect to start."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不必达到某种身材，今天就可以开始。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You don’t need a certain body. You can start today."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不必达标，\n也能加入。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No need to be perfect\nto join."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不排名，不鼓励极端减脂；不舒服时停止训练。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No rankings and no extreme cutting. Stop training when you feel unwell."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不需要提供身体照片或体脂数据" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No body photos or body fat data needed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "主要肌群：%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Main muscles: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "人人都有位置" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Everyone Has a Place"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅共享训练、饮水、睡眠是否记录，以及训练场景。不共享具体数值、HealthKit 样本或会员信息。关闭后停止共享；离线手表会在下次连接时清除显示，小组件刷新由系统安排。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shares only whether training, water and sleep are logged, plus where you train. It doesn’t share values, HealthKit samples or membership details. Turning it off stops sharing. An offline watch clears its display the next time it connects, and the system decides when widgets refresh."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今天已记录 %lld mL。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld mL logged today."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从今天减去 %lld mL" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Subtract %lld mL from Today"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "代表姿势" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Key Pose"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "以上基础功能也可免登录使用。付费会员尚未开放，本版不会收取费用。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can use the basic features above without signing in. Paid membership isn’t available, and this version doesn’t charge anything."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "以这个名字，\n加入俱乐部。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Join the club\nunder this name."
