    },
    "会员纪念卡" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keepsake Card"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会员身份由俱乐部服务保存，日常记录仍留在本机。多人小队和线上社区尚未开放。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The club service stores your membership. Your daily records stay on this device. Group squads and the online community aren’t available yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你仍可使用所有手动记录功能。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can still use all manual logging features."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你决定分享哪些数据" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You Decide What to Share"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你可以在健康 App 中管理薄肌的访问权限。断开查询只清除本 App 的显示，不撤销系统授权，也不删除健康 App 的记录。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can manage Lean Muscle’s access in the Health app. Disconnecting only clears what this app shows. It doesn’t revoke system permission or delete records in the Health app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你的会员卡" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your Member Card"
          }
        }
      }
    },
