        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Health Data and Permissions"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先填写邮箱，再选择需要的邮件。验证或重置完成后，返回这里登录。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enter your email first, then choose the email you need. After you verify or reset, come back here to sign in."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先热身，再开始。课程是通用入门参考，不是个性化处方。有伤病时先咨询专业人员；出现疼痛、头晕或不适时立即停止。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Warm up first. Courses are general starting points, not personal prescriptions. If you have an injury, talk to a professional first. Stop at once if you feel pain, dizziness or discomfort."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先验证邮箱，再领取会员卡。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
